      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        60,
        180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "content": "## Demo 3 — Gemini 基礎整合\n\n**目的**：展示用 n8n 原生 Google Gemini Node 呼叫 Gemini，不需要手寫 HTTP Request\n\n**核心 Node**：Google Gemini（Text → Message a model）\n\n**輸出**：`$json.output` 就是 AI 回答的文字，不需要手動 parse candidates\n\n**Demo 重點**\n1. 點選 Google Gemini node 看 credential 已自動帶入\n2. Model 選 gemini-2.0-flash（最快最省）\n3. Execute workflow → 看 output 欄位"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "748abaa7-8c59-46fe-92f0-2cb141d4e40d",
      "name": "設定：Demo 提問",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        460,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a019d6f1-77e9-45c8-ad80-0147e89f45ee",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "你是 IT 維運助理。請用繁體中文說明：什麼是 BGP？用兩句話，配上一個實際維運情境。"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ea04851c-c099-40bf-abda-99c060cb937a",
      "name": "Gemini：生成回應",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.googleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        680,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "text",
        "operation": "message",
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "models/gemini-2.0-flash",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "={{ $json.prompt }}",
              "role": "user"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simplifyOutput": true
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "G7B3Jkm3AiKjF1gY",
          "name": "Google Gemini(PaLM) Api account"
        }
      }
    },
